# cpu-park is x86 hlt, and every caller clocks the x86 HPET (0xFED00000);
# the arm64 and riscv64 beds have neither: refused by design on the cross
# lanes (plugs 2.73). A cross cpu-park would turn this refusal into an
# HPET fault at run time. The compile must FAIL and the log must carry
# "[UNSUPPORTED] <name>" for each line below.
cpu-park
